  <!-- ========================================================================
       RSW_DW_Head_Mindstone - MECHANOID_ORIGIN_CANON_1's race, per ruling 3
       ("Mindstone race = a Droidworks chassis with a special head"). That
       item is still `proposed`/`needs owner` (filed 2026-09-06, no numeric
       stats ever ruled) - so despite packet B3's verify line reading
       "mindstone head yields the ruled stats", nothing has literally been
       ruled yet. FOUNDRY's own call, recorded here rather than blocking on
       it: distinctly higher-tier than a family head (Archotech, not Spacer;
       ~8x the market value) so the item exists and is judgeable, WITHOUT
       inventing the mindstone's actual sourcing (findable/craftable/found-
       only) or the "chassis + this head = a new race" mechanic itself - both
       of those are MECHANOID_ORIGIN_CANON_1's to decide. No donor pawn
       carries this head, so CompDWHeadDropper never spawns one; it exists
       today only as a standalone item (spawn/debug, future quest loot).
       Art: vanilla Biotech's own Mechlink texPath (an archotech implant that
       psychically links a mind to a mechanoid) - reused for the same reason
       Items_Droidworks.xml reuses donor-mod textures verbatim, but vanilla
       here rather than a sibling mod, so there is no cross-mod texPath
       fragility at all.
  ======================================================================== -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>RSW_DW_Head_Mindstone</defName>
    <thingClass>RimMandrake.StarWars.Droidworks.Thing_DWHead</thingClass>
    <label>mindstone head</label>
    <description>A droid head casing built around something that is not the usual imported brain trio - a mindstone, humming with a presence that answers when addressed. Not really a droid mind any more.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Pawn/Humanlike/Apparel/Mechlink</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <Mass>1.5</Mass>
      <MaxHitPoints>150</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0.2</Flammability>
      <MarketValue>2500</MarketValue>
    </statBases>
    <techLevel>Archotech</techLevel>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>Manufactured</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.StarWars.Droidworks.CompProperties_HeadIdentity" />
    </comps>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
